{"payload":"{\"app\":\"hotel-paris\",\"from\":\"1.9.70\",\"version\":\"1.9.71\",\"notes\":\"Ponto: Relatório do ponto mensal ou diário (todos ou um funcionário) com entrada, intervalo, retorno, saída, trabalhado, saldo do dia e banco de horas. Travas: 'Desbloqueio do sistema com ponto' virou opção própria, separada da cobrança do ponto e do bloqueio de tela.\",\"files\":{\"index.html\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"7d1fc19da229cf46053a8c3d10a975817294e011af77067dea2968b73844b85e\"},\"mobile.html\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"4117889e514d67b91e78f9afddd50365fc60aa2da3dc37d66763746d229436ad\"},\"limpeza.html\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"1cabda4edb1fa428507919c72aebc8dff9078e8de8ce1376c2dfe92c32ebb42e\"},\"remote-bridge.js\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"1c226ecbe755787df5500c28894a2a3380175267329b9f01e23f08e627c798f6\"},\"main.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"b0ea88786ab879761cfa617a7d4f403de1b9f8b30f9f64cd3287f9891511d817\"},\"finance.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"33ddac4fb87cb49bb5666adaf49be607c593ba269203d61d89288697a3a98012\"},\"accounts.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"77c8425b47817105cb1cbe5948ef0ebac98b5924b9cf931ce3176aaa61b3939f\"},\"storage.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"fc5952174d763f1e60fa663a0b04f70025bcd2f481abd8258ae0310df4888cfb\"},\"server.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"e1a18651bc529df42ec2d8bf8cb2cc0998ff5eb4831bc5db7d8d8991b74e04ee\"},\"updates.cjs\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"f483f9b28f1d6a829bac2cfd612ce76f93220a69f82be4849643c6c094fe16ae\"},\"features.js\":{\"data\":\"\",\"sha256\":\"bbdc4d02514e5b9cdb78f9dbbccc91b8520f66e73857d92d4aeed7821ed56888\"},\"package.json\":{\"data\":\"ewogICJuYW1lIjogImhvdGVsLXBhcmlzIiwKICAicHJvZHVjdE5hbWUiOiAiSG90ZWwgUGFyaXMiLAogICJ2ZXJzaW9uIjogIjEuOS43MSIsCiAgIm1haW4iOiAiYm9vdHN0cmFwLmNqcyIsCiAgInByaXZhdGUiOiB0cnVlLAogICJkZXNjcmlwdGlvbiI6ICJQYWluZWwgbG9jYWwgSG90ZWwgUGFyaXMgcGFyYSBXaW5kb3dzIgp9Cg==\",\"sha256\":\"ad260ac92bfdfa461c82f49b4f01b58fe96c179b421d9a6802d1808eca549609\"}}}","signature":"3VcN9HS53zH